2. The keep-panel rule never ends. onRun must not hidePanel so Cmd-1 can accept, but runOfferedAction / runAction never order the panel out. CaretPanel is .floating. execute then starts computer-use-jev to drive GitHub under that panel. Unit 5 must claim the offer (so invalidateContextualOffers keeps the executing id), then orderOut the panel before Jev starts, without a hidePanel that resumes capture and tears down the offer before accept is sent.

